{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/","title":"비만침 AA3","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 비만침의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"비만침 AA3\n분류\n이침 · 코드 AA3\n위치\n비만침: 위, 비, 기점, 내분비\n취혈\n자침·주의\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","sections":[{"title":"분류","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/#_1","text":"이침 · 코드 AA3","links":[]},{"title":"위치","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/#_2","text":"비만침: 위, 비, 기점, 내분비","links":[]},{"title":"취혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/#_3","text":"","links":[]},{"title":"자침·주의","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/#_4","text":"","links":[]},{"title":"임상 연결","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/#_5","text":"경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-1287D9542130E840","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa3/","text_sha256":"e02e800661c13867172a2125978f2be16aa3d76e5d5706c4c3d35f790b4018c0","source_sha256":"60f7f8c801cd13b6406e6407af85483f